\end{align*}
and, when $k\equiv 3\pmod{4}$,
\begin{align*}
&\Tr_n\big((x_3 a+x_2 a^{54}+x_1 a^{27}+x_0)(x_3 a^3+x_2 a^2+x_1 a+x_0)\\
&\ \times(x_3 a^3+x_2 a^2+x_1 a+x_0-x_3 a-x_2 a^{54}-x_1 a^{27}-x_0)\big)\enspace.
\end{align*}
After multiplication, reduction using $a^4=1-a$, knowing that $\Tr^n_k(a^i)=0$ for $i=1,2,3$ and using (\ref{eq:Tr_ba}), we obtain for any 
