\[\Tr_n\big(x^{3^k+1}(x-x^{3^k})\big)=\Tr_k\big((-1)^{(k-1)/2}(x_1+x_1^2 x_2+x_1 x_2^2+x_2+x_1^2 x_3+x_2 x_3^2+x_3)\big)\enspace.\]

